  "Html": "<div><html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<title>Rule 67:10:06:03 Personal responsibility agreement.</title>\r\n<META NAME=\"Keywords\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:10:06:03\">\r\n<META NAME=\"Description\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:10:06:03 Personal responsibility agreement.\">\r\n<meta name=Generator content=\"Microsoft Office HTML Filter 2.0\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=Content-Type content=\"text/html; charset=windows-1252\">\r\n<meta name=Originator content=\"Microsoft Word 10\">\r\n<title>CHAPTER 67:10:06</title>\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n \r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body lang=EN-US>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>67:10:06:03.&nbsp;&nbsp;Personal responsibility agreement.</b> Unless\r\nexempt under §&nbsp;67:10:06:07, as a condition of eligibility for assistance\r\nunder this article, the parent must sign a personal responsibility agreement.\r\nFailure to sign the agreement results in ineligibility for the assistance unit.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Source:</b> 24 SDR\r\n24, effective August 31, 1997.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>General Authority:</b>\r\nSDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-7A-3\">28-7A-3(1)(2)(3)(4)</A>, <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-7A-10\">28-7A-10</A>, <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-7A-11\">28-7A-11.</A></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Law Implemented:</b>\r\nSDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-7A-3\">28-7A-3(1)(2)(3)(4)</A>, <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-7A-10\">28-7A-10</A>, <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-7A-11\">28-7A-11.</A></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n</div>",
